+      <h2 class="h2 split" id="reg-title">Your Experts Approve <span class="grad-text">Every Section</span></h2>
+      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--d:120">The output is bounded by your source documents. Where the source does not carry something, the section does not carry it either.</p>
+      <ul class="checklist" data-reveal style="--d:180">
